package "pkg/std/math"

// Asymptotic (large-x) expansion machinery for the order-0 and order-1
// Bessel functions: the pzero / qzero / pone / qone helpers and their
// coefficient tables.  Split out of bessel01.bn to keep both files under
// the length cap; J0 / J1 / Y0 / Y1 (in bessel01.bn, same package) call
// these.  Ported from Go math/j0.go + math/j1.go (FreeBSD fdlibm).

